---
// Ficha de O143, portada del prototipo (posiciones del frame de Figma de 1320 px).
---

<div class="pj pj-o143">
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 796);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 97)">
    <div class="pj-img m-plan" style="--x:90;--y:0;--w:1139;--h:796"><picture><source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="/img/o143/01-planta-movil.png"><img src="/img/o143/01-planta.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></picture></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 503);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 186)">
    <div class="pj-img m-right" style="--x:562;--y:0;--w:757;--h:503"><img src="/img/o143/02.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- Texto y foto pequeña, uno al lado del otro -->
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 339);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 109)">
    <div class="pj-text m-side" style="--x:88;--y:119;--w:731">
      <p>A renovation built around colour. Colour becomes the thread that links the spaces, marking transitions and shaping a home that feels both cohesive and personal. Work in progress in Madrid.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pj-img m-right m-side" style="--x:894;--y:0;--w:335;--h:339"><img src="/img/o143/03.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="pj-block" style="height:calc(var(--f) * 1008);margin-top:calc(var(--f) * 66)">
    <div class="pj-img m-left" style="--x:0;--y:0;--w:635;--h:1008"><img src="/img/o143/04.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</div>
